  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      418.45,
      547.23,
      468.52
    ],
    "text": "ACCORDING to the powers conferred in (Chapter 267) Second Part (1) Sub-section of Entertainment Tax Ordinance,under-mentioned resolution determined by the Secretary of Gampola Urban Council which was approved by the Minister incharge for Local Government, Central Provincial Council as per the powers specified in Section II of the Ordinance onEntertainment Taxation is hereby published based on its second Sub-section.",
